Package: islandbrand
Title: Island Health Branding for R Figures, Tables and Reports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Temuulen", "Enebish", , "temuulen@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Applies Island Health brand colours, typography and layout to
    ggplot2 figures, including epidemic curves and surveillance graphics,
    flextable and gt tables, and Quarto HTML and Word reports. Includes project
    scaffolding for reproducible reports used by the PHASE team.
